flowchart LR
  A[Current LLM-agent social simulation\nPersona + memory + agent-agent messages] --> B{Plausible transcripts\nlook human-like?}
  B -->|Often over-interpreted| C[Collective outcomes\nused for causal / policy claims]
  C --> D[Epistemic risk\nPrompt, scheduling, exposure, priors\nmay dominate results]

  A -. mismatch .-> E[Role-playing plausibility\n≠ faithful human behavior]
  A -. mismatch .-> F[Agent-agent interaction\n≠ social dynamics]

  G[Environment-involved simulator] --> H[Environment E\npolicy, institutions, resources]
  G --> I[Visibility Vis\nwho sees what]
  G --> J[Scheduler Sch\nwho acts when]
  G --> K[Transition Tr + reward R\nactions → consequences]
  G --> L[Initial distribution D0\npopulation, graph, priors]
  G --> M[Agent policy P + mental update U]

  H --> N[Auditable assumptions]
  I --> N
  J --> N
  K --> N
  L --> N
  M --> N

  N --> O[Mechanistic & counterfactual evaluation]
  O --> P[Mechanism ablations]
  O --> Q[Counterfactual sweeps]
  O --> R[Uncertainty reporting]
  P --> S[More cautious inference\nfrom plausibility to evidence]
  Q --> S
  R --> S
